sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Администратор
    participant M as OTA Orchestrator
    participant C as Rollout Controller
    participant K as Kafka
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    A->>M: POST /v1/campaigns/{id}/rollback
    M->>C: gRPC ForceRollback(campaign_id)

    Note over C: Флаг «не оценивать» (in-memory)

    C->>K: Публикация rollout.decisions (type=rollback, новый decision_id)
    C-->>M: gRPC Response OK
    M-->>A: HTTP 202 Accepted

    K->>M: Консьюм rollout.decisions
    M->>PG: Проверка applied_decisions (идемпотентность)

    alt decision_id новый
        M->>PG: UPDATE campaigns SET status='rolled_back'
        M->>PG: UPDATE stages SET status='failed' WHERE status='active'
        M->>PG: INSERT into applied_decisions
    else decision_id уже применён
        Note over M: No-op
    end
